From 42957b360a71c8144ecc9b43a715dd6c4d82ab81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:41:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Town interiors: ten new rooms behind the new town's
 doors, things, hosts, merc quests
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

docs/design/town.md D/F: owl_library, merc_office, general_store, kangkang_forge,
juju_diner, boutique, dojo, pet_house, dongdong_apt and bogle_lab as editor maps, each a
diorama in its own style with themed hosts (full hero looks) and interactive objects
(`thing: true`, whitelisted in npcFrom): the specimen case and records tablet and three
lore books in the library, the request and party boards at the mercenaries', the anvil,
the mirror, the job scroll, the mailboxes, the hall's town map. 피피 and 모모 move from the
hall to the library; keepers sell only their own goods (the forge's armourer: tier-1
weapons, armour, runes); the diner's stove is a hearth. links.json gets every building
door at the new town's tiles, the rooms and willow land on the new steps, 아르센 and 다람
move. Three side quests for 용병단장 그레이. Room styles and poses join ROOM_STYLES and
NPC_POSES. tests/interiors.mjs checks all thirteen rooms against the frozen contract;
its town-side round trips run once the 100x76 town is in (until then the door tiles lie
outside the old town, so data:check, world, party, jobs and data fail on this branch alone).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VHqoygdSy8NpLoKVbn9QhA
